From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] luma: notifications arrive above the shelf and wait on a shelf beacon

Banners are placed from the Shelf's live allocation, 14 above it and 14 from the screen edge on the focused monitor, newest at the corner, at most three with the rest queued. Cards follow the notification spec's anatomy and motion, expire after 7 s to a shelf beacon, and the tray opens from the beacon and Quick Options.
